<title>HUNGARY: Hungary Nov intl. reserves drop to $9.8bln - c.bank.</title>
<headline>Hungary Nov intl. reserves drop to $9.8bln - c.bank.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-01-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungary's international reserves stood at $9.8 billion at the end of November, down from $10.1 billion at the end of October, the National Bank of Hungary said in a statement on Wednesday.</p>
</text>
